      "ai_full_markdown": "# AI 综合回答：四界\n\n## 直接回答\n四界指地界、水界、火界、风界 [1]。这一列举在相应部中也被称为“四界” [2][7][8]。\n\n## 要点展开\n### 四界的构成\n- 四界包括地界、水界、火界、风界 [1]。\n- 相应部经文多次提及“有这些四界”，并询问具体是哪四个 [7][8]。\n\n### 各界的单独提及\n- 地界有专门的经文标题“地界经” [3]。\n- 水界、火界、风界在中部经文中分别被提问“什么是水界？”、“什么是火界？”、“什么是风界？” [4][5][6]。\n\n## 分歧与张力\n现有证据未显示不同来源对四界内容有分歧，均一致指向地、水、火、风四界。\n\n## 证据覆盖情况\n现有证据覆盖了四界的名称列举及其在相应部、中部中的提及，但未涉及四界的定义、性质或修行意义等具体内容。\n\n## 引用\n- [1] Early Buddhist · DN33 · 四界 · source — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=dn33&lang=zh&q=%E5%9B%9B%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A8_dn&mt=%E5%9C%B0%E7%95%8C%E3%80%81%E6%B0%B4%E7%95%8C%E3%80%81%E7%81%AB%E7%95%8C%E3%80%81%E9%A2%A8%E7%95%8C%E3%80%82\n  > 四界：地界、水界、火界、风界。\n- [2] Early Buddhist · 经藏/相应部_sn · sn14.30 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=sn14.30&lang=zh&q=%E5%9B%9B%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E9%83%A8_sn&au=zhuang&mt=%E9%80%99%E4%BA%9B%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%9B%E7%95%8C%E3%80%82\n  > 这些是四界。\n- [3] Early Buddhist · 经藏/相应部_sn · sn25.9 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=sn25.9&lang=zh&q=%E5%9C%B0%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E9%83%A8_sn&au=zhuang&mt=%E5%9C%B0%E7%95%8C%E7%B6%93\n  > 地界经\n- [4] Early Buddhist · 经藏/中部_mn · mn28 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=mn28&lang=zh&q=%E6%B0%B4%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E4%B8%AD%E9%83%A8_mn&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E6%98%AF%E6%B0%B4%E7%95%8C%EF%BC%9F\n  > 什么是水界？\n- [5] Early Buddhist · 经藏/中部_mn · mn28 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=mn28&lang=zh&q=%E7%81%AB%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E4%B8%AD%E9%83%A8_mn&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E6%98%AF%E7%81%AB%E7%95%8C%EF%BC%9F\n  > 什么是火界？\n- [6] Early Buddhist · 经藏/中部_mn · mn28 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=mn28&lang=zh&q=%E9%A2%A8%E7%95%8C&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E4%B8%AD%E9